hpc:LsbStageStorage a owl:Class .

hpc:hasResourceName an owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:LsbStageStorage ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:reportsavailablestorage a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:LsbStageresource ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:reportstotalstorage a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:LsbStageresourcemax ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

hpc:LsbStageresource a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:LsbStageStorage ;
    owl:hasValue rdfs:datatype xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:subClassOf owl:ObjectPropertyDomain ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf hpc:hasResourceName ;
    owl:inverseOf hpc:reportsAvailableStorage .

hpc:LsbStageresourcemax a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:LsbStageStorage ;
    owl:hasValue rdfs:datatype xsd:decimal ;
    rdfs:subClassOf owl:ObjectPropertyDomain ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf hpc:hasResourceName ;
    owl:inverseOf hpc:reportsTotalStorage .


This ontology fragment defines a class `hpc:LSB_STAGE_STORAGE` for resources that report available storage space for direct data staging. It also defines two object properties `hpc:hasResourceName` and two datatype properties `hpc:reportsAvailableStorage` and `hpc:reportsTotalStorage`. The properties are used to describe the resource name and the reported available and total storage space. The `hpc:LSB_StageResource` and `hpc:LSB_StageResourceMax` classes are subclasses of `hpc:LSB_STAGE_STORAGE` and are used to represent the resources that report the available and total storage space, respectively.
